Package: libstereo-layer1
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, qml6-module-qtquick, libstereo-declare1, libkscreen-bin (>= 4:6.7.4-1+stereo3d4), libkf6screen8 (>= 4:6.7.4-1+stereo3d4), kimageformat6-plugins (>= 6.30.0-1+stereo3d2), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.11.2+dfsg-5+stereo3d5)
Description: Shared stereo picture policy and Qt presentation
 File marks, input choices, picture geometry and anaglyph conversion are
 shared by Qt widget and Quick picture viewers. Stereo content uses its own
 declared surface while the application's controls stay two dimensional.
 Anaglyph originals remain unchanged on anaglyph outputs. Reconstructed
 colours on true stereo outputs are approximate; files are never changed.
 .
 Sparky Stereo OS, Daniel Ramos's edition of SparkyLinux (by Paweł "pavroo"
 Pijanowski).

