Description: Development files for the shared stereo picture layer
 Headers and CMake targets for stereo picture policy, Qt widget presentation
 and the org.sparky.stereo QML item.

Package: libstereo-policy1
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Shared stereo policy for programs without Qt
 How a stereo mark reads (the Stereo3DLayout words of RFC 9559 StereoMode and
 H.264/H.265 Table D-8), which packing a video frame holds, whether its views
 are full or half, and the user's correction, as a small C library a browser
 or a player can load. libstereo-layer builds on it, so every program
 decides alike.
 .
 Sparky Stereo OS, Daniel Ramos's edition of SparkyLinux (by Paweł "pavroo"
 Pijanowski).

