Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libstereo-policy1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for the shared stereo policy without Qt
 The C header stereo-policy.h and the pkg-config file stereo-policy.pc.
